  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Robert Lewandowski won everything in twenty twenty. Then they cancelled the award.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "ROBERT LEWANDOWSKI",
        "sub": "Bayern Munich · 2019/20",
        "pill": "ROBBED TWICE?",
        "person": "lewa"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fifty-five goals in all competitions. Thirty-four in the league, six in the cup, fifteen in the Champions League.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "2019/20",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "55",
            "l": "goals, all comps"
          },
          {
            "n": "34",
            "l": "Bundesliga"
          },
          {
            "n": "6",
            "l": "German Cup"
          },
          {
            "n": "15",
            "l": "Champions League"
          }
        ],
        "person": "lewa"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bayern won the treble, and he was top scorer in the Bundesliga and in Europe.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "Bundesliga"
          },
          {
            "kind": "cup",
            "label": "German Cup"
          },
          {
            "kind": "bigears",
            "label": "Champions League"
          }
        ],
        "person": "lewa"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But France Football had already decided. No Ballon d'Or in twenty twenty. The first time it was ever cancelled.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "CANCELLED",
        "person": "lewa",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The reason? No fair conditions, after a season broken up by Covid.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "BALLON D'OR 2020",
        "body": "France Football cancels the award for the first time in its history, saying the season did not give fair conditions to judge it."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bayern's boss Karl-Heinz Rummenigge said it wasn't fair on his striker.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "lewa",
        "label": "Bayern: 'not fair'",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lewandowski said it straight.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "quote",
        "person": "lewa",
        "text": "I deserved to win the Ballon d'Or."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So he went again. Forty-one Bundesliga goals, breaking Gerd Müller's record of forty from nineteen seventy-two.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Most Bundesliga goals in a season",
        "left": {
          "person": "lewa",
          "label": "Lewandowski 2020/21",
          "value": "41"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "muller",
          "label": "Müller 1971/72",
          "value": "40"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty twenty-one. Surely this was his year.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "lewa",
        "mood": "happy",
        "stamp": "HIS YEAR?"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Messi six hundred and thirteen points. Lewandowski five hundred and eighty. Second.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "podium",
        "year": "2021",
        "title": "Ballon d'Or",
        "places": [
          {
            "person": "messi",
            "club": "arg"
          },
          {
            "person": "lewa",
            "club": "bay"
          },
          {
            "person": "jorginho",
            "club": "che"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirty-three points short.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "left": {
          "person": "messi",
          "label": "Messi",
          "value": "613"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "lewa",
          "label": "Lewandowski",
          "value": "580"
        },
        "title": "2021 Ballon d'Or"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then Messi turned to him on stage and said this.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "quote",
        "person": "messi",
        "text": "Robert, you deserve your Ballon d'Or."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "What he got instead was a brand new prize. Striker of the Year. The first one ever.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "boot",
            "label": "Striker of the Year 2021"
          }
        ],
        "person": "lewa"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Two seasons at the top of the world. Zero Ballon d'Ors.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Lewandowski's Ballon d'Ors",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "2",
            "l": "monster seasons"
          },
          {
            "n": "0",
            "l": "Ballon d'Ors"
          }
        ],
        "person": "lewa"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Robbery, or just the worst luck in football? Tell me in the comments.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "ROBBED",
        "person": "lewa",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "cta"
      }
    }
  ]
}